====Derived terms====
{{der-top}}
* {{l|en|capstan bar}} - ''one of the long bars or levers by which the capstan is worked; a handspike.''
* {{l|en|pawl the capstan}} - ''to drop the [[pawl]]s so that they will catch in the notches of the pawl ring, and prevent the capstan from turning back.''
{{der-mid}}
* {{l|en|rig the capstan}} - ''to prepare the for use, by putting the bars in the sockets.''
* {{l|en|surge the capstan}} - ''to slack the tension of the rope or cable wound around it.''
{{der-bottom}}

